Brian Ward <brianward@delphi.com> writes:

>  
> I've got a DecStation 3100 that tries to initialize, gets to 7...6...5...4
> ...3 and commits FAILURE, and gives a '>>' prompt.  Never having seen a
> broken DEC and only rarely a working one, I need to know what my options
