Marco E. Nicosia (marco@server.berkeley.edu) wrote:
: I have some semi-unhappy dec 5000/200's that, on powerup will complain
: RST?

: However, if I hit ^C and then do full tests, and the machine passes with
: flying colors. I looked in the manual for an RST, but I didn't see anything.

: Help?

Sounds like you have the monitor variable "haltaction" set to "r", which means
"restart" (I think?).  By reporting "RST?" I suspect the DECstation is
complaining that there is nothing *to* restart.

The value of "haltaction" you really want is "b", for "boot".
