Some time ago I posted a report of a problem I encountered with
VMS 6.2's backup sending a TZ87 attached to an HSD10 in a BA350 into
mount-verify.

This problem has moved on. If you are getting similar problems, read on...

Workaround: reduce the working set of the backup process - I get no problems
with a working set of 8192 applied - this throttles the data flow 
sufficiently to alleviate the problem.

Fix: Is promised to be in a new version of the TZ87 firmware to be
in field test soon.

Hope this is helpful.
