> I have a MicroVAX II in a BA23 enclosure, with a hard drive
> plugged into Disk 0, and the Drive Select set to DS3.
> 
> to boot from Disk 0.  What should the Drive Select be on the
> Disk 0 and Disk 1 drives in order to support two drives in
> the BA23 enclosure?
> 

	The jumper on the second hard drive should be set to DS4
in a BA23 box.  There is a good chance that you have now damaged
the formatting of the first hard drive, making the data inaccessible.
The only fix is to reformat.



