approx.  2 to 3x fast than a pentium 90, but you are limited to 286
emulation.  (Now - before anyone flames me and says that an Alpha 2100-200
only emulates 286 at 486-25/50 speeds, has to remember that Visual Basic
is primarily an interpreter for WinAPI codeUniv.  The WinAPI code is Native
on the Alpha, and seems well optimized.)

