Peter is correct. The DEQNA was no longer support after 5.4
from the SPD
DEQNA Ethernet controller to Q-bus. The minimum revision level
required is K3. All systems utilizing a DEQNA must operate with 
software data checking enabled. Since AUTOGEN will automatically 
set the correct parameter, no system management intervention is
required. Not supported by VAXcluster software. Not supported for
any interfaces except for access using QIO or ALTSTART interfaces.
