Raimund Vogl (vogl@string.uibk.ac.at) wrote:
: Hi! I got quite a silly question!
:   We got a VAXserver 4100A with an MKA500  DAT tape drive. The hardware
: switch on the drive says that compactification is enabled. 
: But SH DEV/FULL MKA500 says that compactification is disabled.
: Can somebody tell me how to enable compactification on that tape drive?

: Thanks

:   Raimund


See VMS HELP on /MEDIA_FORMAT option:

  o HELP INITIALIZE /MEDIA_FORMAT
  o HELP MOUNT /MEDIA_FORMAT
  o HELP BACKUP /MEDIA_FORMAT

If HELP doesn't recognize the /MEDIA_FORMAT option, then a VMS upgrade
may be in order. I don't recall the minimum version that supports 
compaction for VAXes.

