> mounting bracket. Does anyone know where to get these brackets from. I have
> had no luck tracking these down.
> 

Storageworks carriers are available from several vendors (Merisel, Bytewide
etc) as well as Digital. The Digital part numbers for the carriers are
SWXBA-BB removeable media (ie tape drives) 3.5 inch
SWXBA-BA fixed media devices 3.5 inch (disks)

These carriers aren't much good for the newer WIDE drives such as the 
Seagate HAWK 4 family since the drives have a SCSI 68 pin connector 
rather than the 50 pin BERG connector used in the carrier cable assembly.

The other bracket you mentioned is Hard disk bracket mounting assembly
part number 74-46538-01, I believe and sells for about $14.00 CAD. 
from Digital.


